{"ticker":"AFRM","updated":"2026-11-06T22:38:20Z","profile":{"longName":"Affirm Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"Affirm Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.affirm.com","fullTimeEmployees":2358,"marketCap":22981761024,"trailingPE":12.316455,"forwardPE":13.5789,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.006962,"pegRatio":7.47,"targetMeanPrice":97.87176,"targetHighPrice":115.0,"targetLowPrice":66.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":34,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.352,"earningsGrowth":1.029,"grossMargins":0.48951998,"operatingMargins":0.14819,"profitMargins":0.43862,"totalRevenue":4589961216,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":90.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":42.095,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Affirm Holdings, Inc. operates payment network in the United States, Canada, and internationally. Its platform offers pay-over-time solutions at checkout for both consumers and merchants. The company's commerce platform, agreements with originating banks, and capital markets partners enables consumers to pay for a purchase over time. It has active merchants covering small businesses, large enterprises, direct-to-consumer brands, brick-and-mortar stores, and companies with an omni-channel presence. The company's merchants represent a range of industries, including electronics; equipment and auto; fashion and beauty; general merchandise; home and lifestyle services; sporting goods and outdoors; and travel and ticketing. Affirm Holdings, Inc. was founded in 2012 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Affirm Holdings, Inc. 在美國、加拿大和國際上營運支付網路。其平台為消費者和商家提供結帳時按時付費的解決方案。該公司的商務平台、與發款銀行和資本市場合作夥伴的協議使消費者能夠隨著時間的推移支付購買費用。它擁有活躍的商家，涵蓋小型企業、大型企業、直接面向消費者的品牌、實體店以及擁有全通路業務的公司。該公司的商家代表了一系列行業，包括電子；設備和汽車；時尚與美麗；百貨;家庭和生活服務；體育用品和戶外用品；以及旅行和票務。 Affirm Holdings, Inc. 成立於 2012 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":